======================================================================
8. pH AND RAPIDITY
======================================================================

  FUNDAMENTAL CONNECTION:
  pH = -log10([H+])
  rapidity([H+]) = ln([H+])/2 = -pH * ln(10) / 2
  So: rapidity = -pH * 1.151293
  Equivalently: pH = -rapidity / 1.151293
  The conversion factor ln(10)/2 = 1.151293
  Its reciprocal 2/ln(10) = 0.868589

